{"title":"Career Roadmap · Telecom Technician","role":"Telecom Technician","summary":"A Telecom Technician installs, tests, maintains, troubleshoots and repairs telecommunications equipment and connectivity infrastructure.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Electronics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Telecom Technician installs, tests, maintains, troubleshoots and repairs telecommunications equipment and connectivity infrastructure."},{"type":"p","text":"The role can cover:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fiber-optic networks"},{"text":"Mobile and wireless networks"},{"text":"Broadband and ISP infrastructure"},{"text":"Telecom towers and radio equipment"},{"text":"Transmission systems"},{"text":"Network equipment"},{"text":"Optical communication"},{"text":"Structured cabling"},{"text":"Customer-premises equipment"},{"text":"Network monitoring and troubleshooting"},{"text":"Telecom power systems"},{"text":"4G/5G infrastructure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Electronics","Networking","Fiber Optics","RF Fundamentals","Telecom Equipment","Network Troubleshooting","Field Maintenance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Electronics","Electronics + Communication Fundamentals","Networking Fundamentals","Transmission Systems","Fiber Optics + Optical Communication","RF + Wireless Communication","4G/5G Fundamentals","Telecom Equipment Installation & Testing","Network Troubleshooting","Telecom Internship / Field Training","Telecom Technician","Senior Telecom Technician","Field / Transmission / Fiber Specialist","Telecom Technical Lead / Supervisor"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Horizon","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Electronics, comm